sequenceDiagram

participant STM32 as STM32H743ZI
participant DRDY as DATA_READY GPIO
participant SPI as SPI Bus
participant GPIO as Jetson GPIO IRQ
participant IRQ as Linux Hard IRQ
participant WQ as Kernel Workqueue
participant KFIFO as Kernel kfifo
participant USER as telemetry_reader

loop Every 10 ms

STM32->>STM32: Generate Dummy Telemetry
STM32->>STM32: Build Binary Packet
STM32->>SPI: Load SPI TX Buffer
STM32->>DRDY: DATA_READY HIGH
DRDY->>GPIO: Rising Edge
GPIO->>IRQ: Hardware Interrupt
IRQ->>WQ: schedule_work()
IRQ-->>GPIO: IRQ Exit
WQ->>SPI: SPI Master Transaction
SPI-->>WQ: Receive Packet
WQ->>KFIFO: Push Packet
KFIFO-->>USER: poll()/read()
STM32->>DRDY: DATA_READY LOW

end
